WEBVTT

00:00:58.388 --> 00:01:00.324
And then curiosity got the better of me.

00:01:00.324 --> 00:01:04.628
And I turned around and asked the guy
why he wanted to know if I was with a man.

00:01:05.696 --> 00:01:09.099
"I'm selling timeshares.
It's a real estate thing."

00:01:09.132 --> 00:01:10.901
(Laughter)

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.905
"And you don't sell to women?"

00:01:15.839 --> 00:01:17.274
"Oh, are you interested?"

00:01:18.075 --> 00:01:19.343
"No."

00:01:19.376 --> 00:01:20.677
(Laughter)

00:01:20.711 --> 00:01:23.013
"But you do know
women carry checkbooks, too?"

00:01:23.814 --> 00:01:27.584
And at that, he looked at me and said,
"Wow, lady, you're tough."

00:01:28.118 --> 00:01:29.386
(Laughter)